  "description": "Everybody loves that picture-perfect view at the top of the mountain, right? Let our all new E-Escarpe open the doors to new adventures, making even the toughest climbs and terrain accessible.\n\nThe E-Escarpe shares all the traits of our award winning Escarpe platform, designed to bring you further, faster. With the reliable Shimano STEPS motor system, the E-Escarpe is ready to rip up the trails and take you to new heights.\n\nThe E-Escarpe VRS is a smile inducing E-trail bike thanks to the modern geometry and quality suspension performance that the 140mm Fox Float 36 Performance E-bike specific forks and Fox Float DPS Performance rear shock provide. Pair that with Shimano XT 12 speed drivetrain, SRAM Guide RE brakes, and Shimano E8000 STEPS motor and now anything seems possible. Rolling on DT Swiss H1700 E-bike wheels fitted with Maxxis 3C tubeless ready tyres. Finished off with Nukeproof components and a Brand-X Ascend Dropper. The E-Escarpe VRS is ready for an all-day trail shredding adventure.\n\nE-Escarpe 6061 Alloy Boost 140mm frame\n\nSHIMANO STEPS E8000 Motor\n\nEco, trail or Boost Power modes\n\nShimano XT 12 speed drivetrain\n\nSram Guide RE brakes\n\nTubeless Ready Maxxis 3C Tyres",
